"sha":"a51689914e453ae240c0f3a181f3531bee4ef4fb","message":"setuped for vercel","author":"jaber","date":"2026-08-26T16:30:28Z","url":"https://github.com/JaberChowdhury/task_management/commit/a51689914e453ae240c0f3a181f3531bee4ef4fb"}]}],"readmes":[{"name":"main","readmeHtml":"<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Panze Studio 🚀</h1><a id=\"user-content-panze-studio-\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Panze Studio 🚀\" href=\"#panze-studio-\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Cross-Platform Task &amp; Project Management Studio</strong> built with Flutter &amp; Supabase.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Panze Studio is a project management suite featuring Material 3 expressive design, real-time Supabase cloud sync, multi-theme customization, interactive Kanban workflows, financial tracking, studio calendar scheduling, and super admin controls.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">✨ Features</h2><a id=\"user-content--features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ✨ Features\" href=\"#-features\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>🎯 <strong>Interactive Workflows &amp; Kanban</strong>: Drag &amp; drop tasks, stage pipeline tracking, subtask checkoffs, and priority badges.</li>\n<li>📁 <strong>Project Workspace</strong>: Multi-tab workspace with rich Markdown editor, project tasks table, deliverables, and group notes.</li>\n<li>🎨 <strong>12 Bespoke Theme Palettes</strong>: OneDark, Evergreen, Velvet Crimson, Slate Blue, Sunset Ochre, Nord Frost, Solarized, Dracula, and more in both Light &amp; Dark modes.</li>\n<li>📅 <strong>Studio Calendar &amp; Event Aggregator</strong>: Month, Week, and Agenda timeline streams unifying meetings, task deadlines, and invoice payment milestones.</li>\n<li>💵 <strong>Financials &amp; Invoicing</strong>: Track billables, payments, accounts receivable, and cash flow trends.</li>\n<li>🛡️ <strong>Super Admin Console &amp; RBAC</strong>: Real-time permission controls, runtime feature toggles, team member invitations, and audit trail.</li>\n<li>☁️ <strong>Supabase Integration</strong>: PostgreSQL database, Row Level Security (RLS), Cloud Storage for avatars and project deliverables, and real-time synchronization.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">💻 Platforms Supported</h2><a id=\"user-content--platforms-supported\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 💻 Platforms Supported\" href=\"#-platforms-supported\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>📱 <strong>Android</strong> (APK &amp; App Bundle)</li>\n<li>🪟 <strong>Windows</strong> (x64 Release Executable)</li>\n<li>🐧 <strong>Linux</strong> (Debian <code>.deb</code> &amp; Arch Linux bundle / tarball)</li>\n<li>🌐 <strong>Web</strong> (PWA &amp; Web SPA)</li>\n<li>🍏 <strong>macOS &amp; iOS</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 Getting Started</h2><a id=\"user-content--getting-started\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🚀 Getting Started\" href=\"#-getting-started\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.0