 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clone the repository:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/JaberChowdhury/task_management.git\ncd task_management\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/JaberChowdhury/task_management.git\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> task_management</pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Install dependencies:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"flutter pub get\"><pre>flutter pub get</pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Run unit &amp; widget tests:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"flutter test\"><pre>flutter <span class=\"pl-c1\">test</span></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Launch the application:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Desktop Linux\nflutter run -d linux\n\n# Desktop Windows\nflutter run -d windows\n\n# Chrome Web\nflutter run -d chrome\n\n# Android\nflutter run -d android\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Desktop Linux</span>\nflutter run -d linux\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Desktop Windows</span>\nflutter run -d windows\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Chrome Web</span>\nflutter run -d chrome\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Android</span>\nflutter run -d android</pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\